<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Horror Game - Instructions</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: black;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
        }

        button {
            padding: 10px 20px;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            margin-top: 20px;
            color: black;
            background: white;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background 0.3s;
        }

        button:hover {
            background: gray;
            color: white;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div>
        <h1>How to Play</h1>
        <p>WASD - Move<br>Shift - Run<br>Space - Jump<br>Mouse - Look Around</p>
        <button onclick="window.location.href='index.html'">Back to Menu</button>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
